---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
modpack: sc-final-adventure
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

Install **SC Final Adventure** from [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/sc-final-adventure) into a NeoForge **1.21.1** instance. Allocate enough RAM for a large adventure pack (8 GB is a comfortable starting point).

On first load:

- Follow the FTB Quests chapters. They are the pack’s spine — challenge goals, not a skippable tutorial.
- Survive the overworld long enough to set up a base, then start hitting structures. Loot and world-tier gear are the real progression.
- Expect hybrid combat: Iron’s Spellbooks for casting, Cataclysm and other boss mods for melee set pieces.

Downloads stay on CurseForge. This wiki covers how the pack is meant to be played, not every included mod’s own documentation.
